<section style="padding:90px 0 80px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size:20px;">Built Around You</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Get Specific. Get Better.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub" style="margin:0 auto;">No generic workout. No getting lost in the group.<br><br>We start with the athlete in front of us: where they are, what they're working toward, and what can make the biggest difference in their game.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="skills-cols">
